              <lg xml:id="m-6f23a2f0-87f5-494b-86a0-752d29caeaad">
                <l xml:id="m-f451a532-1e2c-40ba-a483-d44de72101f9" facs="#m-ff4be1fb-9afd-4b8d-b214-db6f0d7487e8" label="ambiguous">124</l><l xml:id="m-856f971d-be1e-4c51-b2f8-928e5b0546a2" facs="#m-7144cbc4-f767-4246-96f3-c857b6290421" label="text-like">Tones for the Y. «Benedicamus Domino».</l><l xml:id="m-2dc0cd4d-5932-4d64-b00a-ad0b2eb60bc4" facs="#m-7a1e35e4-9532-42e9-b326-7c99b8244725" label="text-like">Tone for the Prayers.</l><l xml:id="m-7aece148-fc7e-4fbc-8863-1cad3d516019" facs="#m-f696885c-dd9c-4993-a286-2bd8f8efacb5" label="text-like">On Sundays and Feasts, at Matins, Lauds, and Vespers, the principal</l><l xml:id="m-925181c1-2266-4e26-bf91-71113e109666" facs="#m-167db1c7-fb6b-48d9-9eb3-d269f42017ff" label="text-like">Prayer and also the Prayers of the Suffrage and of the Commemorations are</l><l xml:id="m-30684100-0382-4bc7-8be6-7882400fee3d" facs="#m-f59455f5-8d06-4545-bed0-db1353e0aa3e" label="text-like">as in the Festal tone. p. 98, or in the ancient Solemn tone. p. 100.</l><l xml:id="m-251f7e12-182b-4fb5-bedd-0b14b7613e6b" facs="#m-b34fba93-d421-43d4-aece-2951ba11c6eb" label="text-like">On these same dars, at the Litule Hours and at Compline, the Praræ is</l><l xml:id="m-eb7754cf-2c50-4ead-b6bc-4fea124421ed" facs="#m-e30c3553-3101-4b83-a95e-c60a09268909" label="text-like">sung in the first Ferial tone (A), p. 99, or in the ancient Simple tone, p. 1o1.</l><l xml:id="m-b937016e-772b-4e8e-807f-01e3efb8d3cf" facs="#m-6a26b95a-3102-4d42-a403-d0c0759a4a48" label="text-like">However, when Terce is followed by Pontifical Mass, the Festal tone or</l><l xml:id="m-c547b963-342e-4e41-8401-9284b139e7d7" facs="#m-2cd1db46-cc40-4a8f-bdb0-85408484db55" label="text-like">the ancient Solemn tone is used for the Prayer of that Hour.</l><l xml:id="m-31862624-1a50-4b9a-853b-a83817b4d6f8" facs="#m-eb15de4a-af65-4031-9529-b2ecb40458ea" label="text-like">The second Ferial tone (B), p. 99, or. ad libitum, the ancient Simple tone</l><l xml:id="m-df3143f8-af13-453c-8b24-d798abdd44e9" facs="#m-9709f35f-5140-4a74-abf8-fc418ceea54b" label="text-like">is used for the Prayers follouing the Anthems of Our Ladr at the end ot</l><l xml:id="m-4aa251cc-8d9d-49bd-a37d-a47469966176" facs="#m-f500ab0f-cae7-42f4-9fae-5d30108bdebe" label="text-like">Omce, for the Prayer Dirigere. at Prime, for the Prarers which terminate</l><l xml:id="m-e7670075-c34d-4042-85b5-eece70dd1a82" facs="#m-d5eb6e6a-bd10-40ed-98c0-caf299c1c90b" label="text-like">wuh the short ending in the Office for the Dead and for Burials, and for</l><l xml:id="m-f703a9a3-108c-4f46-aec3-95b74ab91dac" facs="#m-3123a78e-32c5-48ed-bf16-2e8f2a027b76" label="text-like">other Prayers of the same kind.</l><l xml:id="m-341ccfcb-df02-4601-947d-c8c9ae86da25" facs="#m-8b0dc4d9-e5d1-4484-a65b-aad1b53ff2af" label="text-like">The signs t and * which are marked in the Prayers are intended only for</l><l xml:id="m-d6d7ffe5-bc4c-45c8-b736-8056a53a06f9" facs="#m-f0b21870-2307-46c0-9d3a-5175eddad25d" label="text-like">the Ancient tones ad libitum.</l><l xml:id="m-efe885c2-23eb-4ffb-a681-0ce2b7b754e8" facs="#m-d2168d28-57b5-42b4-9e5c-6f5bf67687e4" label="text-like">In the ancient Simple tone, the signt indicates the place ot the fex;</l><l xml:id="m-763e1b87-a75b-424d-9119-0eee7966a576" facs="#m-31f46516-af8f-47c1-a533-cec3362e5c0d" label="text-like">the sign *the place of the metrum. If the former of these signs be absent,</l><l xml:id="m-5799c21f-ce09-452e-9f12-af4a55a11723" facs="#m-a90ff242-adb4-44b6-803d-955c1b25eed0" label="text-like">the fiex is to be omitted.</l><l xml:id="m-025d63a0-83e6-49bd-9625-5fff022f35be" facs="#m-9bd83a8b-e704-4fd2-8685-6b80a1f88954" label="text-like">In the ancient Solemn tone. the fex is made at the sian t:the sim</l><l xml:id="m-34c2ff63-770a-412f-bceb-be47c30b056b" facs="#m-cb0ee212-8918-40a3-8418-43913f6f37b6" label="text-like">tdicates merely a slight pause. Irthe signt be not marked, the fiex is to be</l><l xml:id="m-4815f628-81d0-4658-a64a-ee03aa424dad" facs="#m-d6fdb331-373b-416a-8966-867495f0914d" label="text-like">made at the sign ".</l><l xml:id="m-53e0be72-20e3-45b3-acf8-c44579af3c5b" facs="#m-2d8b0029-d83d-42a6-aae9-09c1256134f0" label="text-like">Tones for the V. « Benedicamus Domino».</l><l xml:id="m-8fe7e1e8-d342-4aa6-9e83-d9d394ffb30b" facs="#m-009311d0-9bbf-41a3-ae73-9bd36284a1eb" label="text-like">I. — On feasts of the I class.</l><l xml:id="m-a80dabe3-dce3-4423-98c3-a6dcb2c96360" facs="#m-37ce1ecc-71c5-4de9-b5ad-cf19d3e52c6d" label="text-like">At Ist Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-ec96d552-2eef-4652-9250-6b8deb934c49" facs="#m-b7164d13-7b01-435c-9a08-ed3b957c902a" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-f4488496-a166-40ab-918e-57b4a82d940c" facs="#m-ca583606-3eb1-4873-92cf-d83aa62a6905" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-211deb23-6958-437b-8c66-2ce1b06ad730" facs="#m-bc577cf3-42e2-48d7-98fe-1577d7ce9ed6" label="lyrics-like">Enedi-cámus Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b899d7c9-e1b9-4ad2-9ad9-db69bc20602b" facs="#m-af44e3a5-f112-48d8-a931-89beeb2e60c7" label="ambiguous">mi-no.</l><l xml:id="m-d8c116ab-3395-4405-9321-e68ec394150f" facs="#m-6cb4b6e0-df28-4bd4-a05c-f771a9d527d5" label="lyrics-like">N. Dé¬ o grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-340bed31-b4c6-4a8f-9a3d-54624d670900" facs="#m-d31d98b2-d148-46fd-be26-eb38f5f00661" label="ambiguous">ti- as.</l><l xml:id="m-e98fa4d9-42df-4352-b74d-b850927177ed" facs="#m-dd63ef1b-bcc2-4ccf-8417-bf01f36769ff" label="text-like">At Lands.</l><l xml:id="m-6e74c3b0-fcb2-4f19-bab5-8462f38c4daf" facs="#m-bc8a4b44-91af-466f-a591-ea58acdf16c7" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-23de582b-e3ee-4d3a-b398-28c4f87fe163" facs="#m-3143c2e1-f69c-42f9-8e3a-b89054d578ae" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-fa205431-c2c3-4170-8c31-f925378bf66a" facs="#m-f8e1bd9b-7891-488e-a185-f187a280f871" label="lyrics-like">Enedi-cámus Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6ee004f3-0d0f-4e9f-a350-abc90df3bf28" facs="#m-749c5fe9-1eb9-4dc1-a3de-c090c878114e" label="ambiguous">mi-no.</l><l xml:id="m-a332f7b8-8f91-4288-bcc7-c3fdd485215e" facs="#m-d0c68f2a-f46b-4e42-b24b-580921914616" label="lyrics-like">R. Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-8f4065b0-0ca9-492b-984c-5fb63b80508b" facs="#m-a9becb78-3626-461b-b60e-a72d4cf207a0" label="lyrics-like">grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b5e0a268-93de-43f1-af29-cbc0c2309481" facs="#m-a05e03ec-9663-4ee8-86ef-331100a0fa9a" label="ambiguous">ti-as.</l><l xml:id="m-94a4e4e2-e04c-4678-8058-c7d3ebc16efc" facs="#m-be92e103-2e5a-47e7-a197-98aac970908f" label="ambiguous">o</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>